The user's own .glb students (Settings → character files) live over the wallpaper: walk and sit on widget edges, head pat, tap = fall, hold = pick up, gifts from the 4x1 «Подарки» widget. Rendered with Google Filament (gltfio) in a translucent TextureView inside the DragLayer; touches outside a chibi pass through.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
